
Version 1.0d4 of Vort/Art for the Macintosh II.
Requires 68020+68881.

This is a Macintosh version of the raytracer and image viewing
tools from vort (the very ordinary rendering toolkit).
This is free software; all source code is provided.

The vort package comes from the University of Melbourne.
The original sources, and lots of images, etc, can
be found at the ftp site gondwana.ecr.mu.oz.au.

The raytracer uses a fairly readable scene description language,
accepts offiles, allows use of images as surface textures,
does CSG modelling, and handles arbitrary algebraic surfaces.

